    "created_at": "2017-05-11T17:18:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-11T17:18:09Z",
    "body": "So concretely, I think we should point out that USVString should be used for URLs or for strings that are to be sent \"over the wire\". I'm not sure what other scenarios there might be.",
