    "body": "For what it’s worth, Firefox’s ongoing style system rewrite uses UTF-8 strings internally. This effectively makes CSSOM strings be `USVString`. CSSWG resolved to allow both, so https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/pull/1266 introduced a `CSSOMString` typedef.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
