    "updated_at": "2025-03-21T03:43:42Z",
    "body": "I would caution against generally using `USVString` on outputs as a sort of comment, similar to how we don't encourage using `required` in that way. However, saying that all URL-valued strings should be `USVString`, including in outputs, seems like a good idea for consistency and for reducing spec maintainer overhead.",
